        "page_idx": 10
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Second quarter adjusted operating income increased nearly 8% year over year, primarily driven by increased prescription and front store volume, partially offset by continued pharmacy reimbursement pressure.",
        "bbox": [
            686,
            279,
            935,
            451
        ],
        "page_idx": 10
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Same store pharmacy sales and same store prescription volumes increased by $\\sim 18\\%^{2}$ and $\\sim 6\\%^{2}$ , respectively, over the prior year quarter.",
        "bbox": [
            686,
            474,
            942,
            590
        ],
        "page_idx": 10
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Continued growth in retail pharmacy script share, reaching \\~27.8% in the second quarter.",
        "bbox": [
            686,
            612,
            928,
            700
        ],
        "page_idx": 10
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Raised 2025 adjusted operating income guidance to at least \\$5.68 billion, reflecting a \\~\\$200 million increase, driven by our strong first half performance, while continuing to maintain a prudent outlook for the remainder of the year.",
        "bbox": [
